      "writtenOn": "2024-12-13T16:38:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Keep in mind I\u0027m trying to cover the case here where the stream-renderer resource already exists i.e. I want to roll platformImportResource into this functionality, and abolish that interface entirely. So in this case, when res_handle already exists, it doesn\u0027t create a new resource. Are we ok with that behavior being somewhat implicit?",
